  "sourceTitle": "Super Simple Pimento Cheese",
  "sourceText": "Super Simple Pimento Cheese\nBy: Kathy Brakhage\nPublished: Tuesday, January 12, 2010 - 10:27am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups shredded sharp cheddar cheese\n2 cups shredded Colby cheese\n2 (4oz) jars diced pimento peppers, drained\n1/2 cup Miracle Whip\nSalt & pepper to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients in a large bowl and mix well. 2 Add more Miracle Whip if it’s not creamy enough. 3 Keep refrigerated.\n\nAbout\n\n\nJust as the name implies, super simple.",
  "parsedSource": {
    "ingredients": [
      {
        "sourceText": "2 cups shredded sharp cheddar cheese"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "2 cups shredded Colby cheese"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "2 (4oz) jars diced pimento peppers, drained"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "1/2 cup Miracle Whip"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "Salt & pepper to taste"
      }
    ],
    "steps": [
      {
        "text": "1 Combine all ingredients in a large bowl and mix well. 2 Add more Miracle Whip if it’s not creamy enough. 3 Keep refrigerated."
      }
    ]
